WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.037
I first saw this man at Eurovision.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:04.870
[CHEERING, APPLAUSE]

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.180
And I thought, who is that?

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.340
Who is that?

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.265
And we all just fell in love with him on the spot.

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:16.470
And if I'm going to rock out with anyone at Christmas,

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.950
it's going to be him.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.805
Please welcome Sam Ryder!

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:24.024
[CHEERING, APPLAUSE]

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.958
["RUN RUDOLPH RUN" PLAYING]

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:30.370
[VOCALIZING]

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.680
(SINGING) Out of all the reindeer,

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.415
you know you're the mastermind.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:38.650
Run, run, Rudolph.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.380
Randolph's not too far behind.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.789
[CLAPPING]

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:45.250
Run, run, Rudolph.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.594
Santa's got to make it to town.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.900
Randolph, he can hurry.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:55.900
He can take the freeway down.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:00.360
And then, away went Rudolph, whizzing like a merry-go-round.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.710
Woo hoo!

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:02.850
Now, let me tell you.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:08.740
Said Santa to a boy child, what have you been longing for?

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:11.820
Well, all I want for Christmas is a rock and roll

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.924
electric guitar.

00:01:14.924 --> 00:01:19.440
And then, away went Rudolph, whizzing like a shooting star.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.830
Run, run, Rudolph.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.750
Santa's got to make it to town.

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:29.860
Santa, make him hurry.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.111
Tell him he can take the freeway down.

00:01:34.111 --> 00:01:39.250
And then, away went Rudolph, whizzing like a merry-go-round.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.300
Merry Christmas.

00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:44.728
Woo hoo!

00:01:53.084 --> 00:01:53.584
Yes!

00:01:56.044 --> 00:01:57.028
Woo hoo!

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:05.230
Said Santa to a girl child, what do you like most to get?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:06.570
I'm ready for you, baby.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:11.462
I want a baby doll who can cry, drink, scream, oh yeah!

00:02:11.462 --> 00:02:12.920
[CHEERING]

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:16.858
And then, away went Rudolph, whizzing like a Saber jet.

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:23.080
Run, run, Rudolph.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.796
Running like a son of a gun.

00:02:25.796 --> 00:02:29.460
Run, run, Rudolph.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.162
Running like a son of a gun.

00:02:32.162 --> 00:02:36.280
Then, away went Rudolph, whizzing like a merry-go-round.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.180
Yeah!

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.780
[CHEERING, APPLAUSE]

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.280
Ah!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.780
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.930
Oh my gosh.

